# Requirements and Traceability

Before changing business behavior:

1. Identify the governing Requirement ID in `docs/v0.1/BUSINESS-REQUIREMENTS.md`.
2. Read its functional detail in `docs/v0.2/FUNCTIONAL-SPECIFICATION.md`.
3. If UI is involved, find the Screen ID in `docs/v0.2/SCREEN-CATALOG.md`.
4. If the requirement is ambiguous, stop only the dependent work and add/report an Open Issue.
5. When an API/DB/Test artifact is created, update `docs/TRACEABILITY-MATRIX.md`.

Do not:
- Rename stable IDs casually.
- Add a feature because it "seems useful".
- Treat placeholder V0.3/V0.4/V0.5/V0.6 documents as approved designs.
